Third-party material
--------------------
Books / Authors / Categories schema (examples/books-authors.json and the
derived figures in docs/figures/books-authors.*): translated from the UML
answer of the PrairieLearn question `erd_e3_books` in the UIUC ERD example
course. Only the entity, attribute, and cardinality facts are reused.

No third-party source code is vendored in this repository. Runtime
dependencies supplied by the PrairieLearn container (chevron, lxml) and
the figure dependency (matplotlib) keep their own licenses.
